# A flight plan: a tour of Sydney Harbour in the Cessna, from off Bondi, north
# to the Heads, west over the Harbour Bridge and up the river to Olympic Park,
# then south-east to Sydney airport - 45 km, about fifteen minutes.
#
#   aircraft NAME
#   start LATITUDE LONGITUDE ALTITUDE_FT HEADING_DEG AIRSPEED_KT     in the air
#   waypoint NAME LATITUDE LONGITUDE ALTITUDE_FT AIRSPEED_KT
#
# Degrees are WGS84's, altitudes above sea level, airspeeds calibrated. The
# navigator flies each leg along its great circle and passes a waypoint when it
# is abeam of it (src/sim/navigator.hpp).

aircraft c172p
start -33.905 151.290 3000 0 100

waypoint THE_HEADS   -33.832 151.292 3000 100
waypoint BRIDGE      -33.852 151.211 2500 100
waypoint OLYMPIC     -33.847 151.063 2500 100
waypoint AIRPORT     -33.946 151.177 3000 90
